# kb opaque media files (W6a) — never commit binaries. No trailing slash so a
# future Mackup symlink is also ignored, not just the real directory. Backup
# ownership is declared in modules/darwin/home-manager/mackup.nix.
.kb/assets
.research/

# kb JsonlStore atomic-write artifacts (backup + tmp; live nodes.jsonl stays tracked)
.kb/nodes.jsonl.bak
.kb/nodes.jsonl.*.tmp
